    <item>
      <title>与俄罗斯军方关联货船在芬兰湾遭无人机袭击起火，漂入芬兰领海</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261123-012646&amp;cat=global&amp;event=evt_6376b1a6cd7b</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261123-012646:evt_6376b1a6cd7b</guid>
